Our Lakehouse contains 3 schema for delta tables:
1) bronze_road
2) silver_road
3) gold_road
And file storage which is relalized for using min resources for this test task in Databricks using Volume, but we can extend this solution using S3 or other file storages.
this file storage has mutiple directories in every we contain files for every table (if we want to update it continiously)
I realized logic only for 2 tables.
In bronze_road there are raw data from CSV files.
In silver layer we try to convert data into format, remove spaces etc. 
"""Because I didnt have additional requirements it is hard to understand in which format data we need. 
So I do minimal clearing data."""
The final result for this layer: we have fact table (with description instead of key).
"""It can be realizied also using UNPIVOT for FACT table and after joining with dim table again PIVOT result. But in this case 
using multiple join instead of rotation operation"""
The gold layer will be contained aggregational data. 
Marts are represented as materialized views. M_IMPACT_VEHICLE contains data how much accidents were every year in one age group for every sex and with different impact on vehicle

